 {
  "id": "ejemplo-2",
  "codigo": 2,
  "nombre": "Ghost of you",
  "lineas": [
   "I wake up in the dead of night, and you're the first thing on my mind.",
   "It hurts so bad... a horror-lovely sensation.",
   "I close my eyes and I can almost feel your skin",
   "I close my eyes and I can almost feel your skin",
   "Manifesting every single kiss we used to win",
   "But then the reality of all the damage creeps back in",
   "We built a castle out of lies where we could never win",
   "Por idealizarte te condené a decepcionarme",
   "And now I’m stuck inside this pain, no sé cómo salvarme.",
   "I miss the ghost of you, but I hate the truth!",
   "You’re not the perfect image that I drew in my mente.",
   "Don't want to lose you, but it hurts to stay,",
   "It’s the same damn poison either way.",
   "A lost soul falling, trying to find the light,",
   "Fighting with my ghosts in the middle of the night",
   "Should I move on or should I fight and change my whole life?",
   "Walking on the edge of a rusty, broken knife.",
   "I’m a hopeless man, floating in the dark,",
   "Looking for a shelter, looking for a spark."
  ],
